# Turing Machine Inspiration Reference Image

This is a placeholder for the Turing machine visualization that inspired the LV Agent design.

Original reference: references/1787293940590_c414ef8c.png

The design draws inspiration from Turing machine concepts:
- Tape-based memory model → Context window management
- State transitions → Agent state management
- Universal computation → Universal tool execution
- Infinite tape → Unbounded context window (theoretical)

The visualization shows a Turing machine tape with read/write head,
symbolizing the agent's ability to read/write/modify its environment
through tools, with infinite theoretical memory (context window).

Reference: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine
